      "writtenOn": "2026-06-05T22:16:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Add a section related to external dependencies pinning.\n\nExample:\n```\n### Pinning external dependencies\n\nWhenever the plugin\u0027s external dependencies are updated, the corresponding lock\nfile needs to be regenerated with a `bazelisk` command.\n\nExample:\n  ln -sf ../../.bazelversion .\n  bazelisk mod deps --lockfile_mode\u003dupdate\n```\n\nThe above would always work and won\u0027t suffer from the maintenance burden of maintaining a copy of the `.bazelversion` file in every plugin\u0027s repository.\n\nRemember that we have *hundreds of plugins*: whenever we bump the `.bazelversion` in Gerrit, we should then bump the `.bazelversion` in hundreds of plugins, which is obviously unsustainable in the long term.",
      "revId": "646b3735965fc44b816109722e6b986067c4c3aa",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
